   * `getCategoryDir()` chokepoint (utils/category-dir.ts → CATEGORY_DIR_MAP) so
   * decision/preference/moment/etc. outputs land in their dedicated dirs
   * (`decisions/`, `preferences/`, ...) instead of collapsing into `facts/`
